# Play test of The Lockkeeper's Isle (CIPlay lockkeepers_isle, in a test world 'CI ...'). Points as in its recipe: the
# landing beach at 0 -33 (0.8 m), the path up to the flat top (3 m); the strongbox shed x 5..8, z 2..5, its door at
# 7.25 2; the goat pen x 9..18, z -15..-6; the lookout at 0 15 (the sea chest). Three quests (the main one, quest=2 Strays, quest=3 The
# Keeper's Log), a keypad code lock, and the island the main quest brings (Lantern Spire, near:self:400:north).
island The Lockkeeper's Isle
offset 0 0
expect step 0
expect title The Keeper's Strongbox
expect title Strays quest=2
expect title The Keeper's Log quest=3
expect step 0 quest=2
expect step 0 quest=3
expect animals Goat 2
expect hidden strongbox
wait 5

# The landing: the first log page on the mooring post, the keeper's board
walk 0 -34 to 0 -32.5 h=0.8
zone landing
expect step 1
read Keeper's log, page 1
expect step 1 quest=3
read Lockkeeper's Isle
# Up the path to the top; the keeper's note, his mother's letter (the code); the sea chest locked before the key
walk 0 -31 to 0 -25 to 0 -19 to -2 -6 h=3
read Keeper's note
expect step 2
read Mother's letter
expect step 3
open Keeper's sea chest
expect step 3
# The code lock: a wrong code keeps it shut, the right one shows the strongbox
code keypad 2741 wrong
expect hidden strongbox
code keypad 2704
expect shown strongbox
expect message strongbox clicks open
open Keeper's strongbox
expect step 4
# Quest 2: the net launcher from the tack chest, the two goats caught
open Tack chest
expect item NetGun 1
catch Goat 2
expect done quest=2
# Quest 3: the pen's page and the lookout's page; the main quest's sea chest
read Keeper's log, page 2
walk -1 10 to 0 13.5 h=3
zone lookout
read Keeper's log, page 3
expect done quest=3
open Keeper's sea chest
expect done
# The island the main quest brings: Lantern Spire, to the north
arrive quest-done
expect title The Light in the North
